  "description": "When his mother became the mistress of a wealthy chairman, Seon-Woo was forced into the role of a “perfect” son in a picture-perfect but hollow family. No matter how hard he tried, he could never measure up... Especially next to Seung-Wook, who seemed to have everything from the start. Their bond fractured, and they went their separate ways. Five years later, Seung-Wook returns from abroad, and their paths cross again. But instead of reconciliation, he offers Seon-Woo a dangerous proposition…one that crosses a line neither of them can ever take back.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
